oints.\n• Roulette: spin the wheel and let fate decide.\n• Bluff: answer a truth… or lie. The group votes on whether you're bluffing.\n• Ticking Bomb: the fuse runs while you play. Holding the phone when it goes off? Double points, and you have to do it.\n\n15 THEMES\nFriends: Classic, Icebreaker, WTF, Epic, Girls night, Young & wild, Spicy, Hardcore 18+, Freaky 18+\nCouples: First date, Deep talk, Couple goals, Date night, Foreplay 18+, Dirty 18+\n\nPLAY FAIR\nSomething crosses a line? Every player gets free passes: skip a card with no penalty and no questions asked. 18+ themes always ask for confirmation first.\n\nFREE TO START\nClassic and First date are free to play. Premium unlocks every theme: choose a weekly plan with a 3-day free trial, or a yearly plan. Only playing tonight? The Party Pass unlocks everything for 48 hours, with no subscription and no renewal.\n\nSubscriptions renew automatically unless cancelled at least 24 hours before the end of the current period. Payment is charged to your Apple ID. You can manage or cancel your subscription in your App Store account settings.\n\nTerms of use: https://truthordare.one/terms-use\nPrivacy policy: https://truthordare.one/privacy-policy","minimumOsVersion":"16.4","primaryGenreName":"Games","primaryGenreId":6014,"genreIds":["6014","7018","6016"],"releaseDate":"2022-06-21T07:00:00Z","userRatingCount":583}